  "id": "tcs-p01",
  "title": "Vehicle Production",
  "level": 5,
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "topic": "Scenario · equations",
  "kind": "pyq",
  "statement": "A factory makes two-wheelers and four-wheelers. The manager knows only the total number of vehicles V and the total number of wheels W. Find how many of each were made.\n\nIf no valid split exists (W odd, too few or too many wheels), print \"INVALID INPUT\".",
  "input_format": "One line with two integers V and W.",
  "output_format": "Two lines: \"TW=<count>\" and \"FW=<count>\", or INVALID INPUT.",
  "constraints": [
   "0 ≤ V, W ≤ 10^9"
  ],
  "samples": [
   {
    "input": "200 540",
    "output": "TW=130\nFW=70",
    "explain": "130·2 + 70·4 = 540"
   },
   {
    "input": "5 7",
    "output": "INVALID INPUT",
    "explain": "Odd number of wheels."
   },
   {
    "input": "3 20",
    "output": "INVALID INPUT",
    "explain": "Even all four-wheelers give only 12 wheels."
   }
  ],
  "hints": [
   "TW + FW = V and 2·TW + 4·FW = W, so FW = (W − 2V) / 2.",
   "Valid only when W is even and 2V ≤ W ≤ 4V."
  ],
  "approach": "Solve the two linear equations: FW = (W − 2V) / 2 and TW = V − FW. Check validity first: W even and 2V ≤ W ≤ 4V. TCS grades the invalid case too, so print its message exactly.",
  "complexity": "O(1)",
  "solutions": {
   "cpp": "#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\nint main() {\n    long long v, w; cin >> v >> w;\n    if (w % 2 != 0 || w < 2 * v || w > 4 * v) { cout << \"INVALID INPUT\" << endl; return 0; }\n    long long fw = (w - 2 * v) / 2;\n    cout << \"TW=\" << v - fw << \"\\nFW=\" << fw << endl;\n}\n",
   "java": "import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long v = sc.nextLong(), w = sc.nextLong();\n        if (w % 2 != 0 || w < 2 * v || w > 4 * v) { System.out.println(\"INVALID INPUT\"); return; }\n        long fw = (w - 2 * v) / 2;\n        System.out.println(\"TW=\" + (v - fw) + \"\\nFW=\" + fw);\n    }\n}\n",
   "python": "v, w = map(int, input().split())\nif w % 2 or w < 2 * v or w > 4 * v:\n    print(\"INVALID INPUT\")\nelse:\n    fw = (w - 2 * v) // 2\n    print(f\"TW={v - fw}\\nFW={fw}\")\n"
  },
